    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not a rut though. it doesn't feel like i'm \"evolving\" or anything. it just feels like i've lost the spark and it's never coming back. i look at my old work and it's like looking at a different person. if i keep going, i'm just going to keep producing garbage until there's nothing left worth remembering. i'd rather stop now while i'm still 'something' than live to see myself become a joke.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
